	(text_box "J8跳线端子配置详情：\n\n1.NOR Flash  启动：断开BOOT_CFG6 (J8-pin1 J8-pin2), 断开BOOT_CFG5 (J8-pin3 J8-pin4)；\n\n2.SD Card    启动：短接BOOT_CFG6 (J8-pin1 J8-pin2), 断开BOOT_CFG5 (J8-pin3 J8-pin4)；\n\n3.NAND Flash 启动：断开BOOT_CFG6 (J8-pin1 J8-pin2), 短接BOOT_CFG5 (J8-pin3 J8-pin4)；\n\n4.BOOT模式控制，内部启动：短接(J8-pin5 J8-pin6)，串行下载：断开(J8-pin5 J8-pin6)；\n\n5.看门狗输出控制，打开输出：断开(J8-pin7 J8-pin8)，关闭输出：短接(J8-pin7 J8-pin8)；"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
